The issue is that your `index.html` file is missing the entry point script tag that loads your React application. When you deploy to Vercel (typically using Vite or a similar build tool), the HTML file needs to explicitly tell the browser which JavaScript/TypeScript file to execute to start the React app.

I have updated `index.html` to include `<script type="module" src="/index.tsx"></script>` inside the `<body>`.

